ont-family:宋体;=20font-size:12.0000pt;=20}=20=20span.msoIns{=20mso-style-type:export-only;=20mso-style-name:"";=20text-decoration:underline;=20text-underline:single;=20color:blue;=20}=20=20span.msoDel{=20mso-style-type:export-only;=20mso-style-name:"";=20text-decoration:line-through;=20color:red;=20}=20=20table.MsoNormalTable{=20mso-style-name:普通表格;=20mso-style-parent:"";=20mso-style-noshow:yes;=20mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;=20mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;=20mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt;=20mso-para-margin:0pt;=20mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt;=20mso-pagination:widow-orphan;=20font-family:'Times New Roman';=20font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-ansi-language:#0400;=20mso-fareast-language:#0400;=20mso-bidi-language:#0400;=20}=20@page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no;=20	mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{=20margin-top:72.0000pt;=20margin-bottom:72.0000pt;=20margin-left:72.0000pt;=20margin-right:72.0000pt;=20size:612.0000pt 792.0000pt;=20mso-header-margin:36.0000pt;=20mso-footer-margin:36.0000pt;=20}=20div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style></head><body style=3D"tab-interval:21pt;" ><!--StartFragment--><div class=3D"Section0" ><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.4.2 大数据下的数据仓库发展历程</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"129"  src=3D"~tmp{9914212b-49a3-4e51-a0ed-1f0514e814e7}135022.files/~tmp{9914212b-49a3-4e51-a0ed-1f0514e814e7}135022166.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >1.&nbsp;起步阶段</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >随着</font>Google&nbsp;2004年提出的大数据三驾马车（分布式文件系统GFS、大数据分布式计算框架Mapreduce、NoSQL数据库系统BIGTABLE）奠定了大数据架构的基础，开启了大数据时代，Hadoop、Spark、ODPS(阿里内部使用) 等各类大数据计算引擎开始登场，给数据仓库的发展带来了新的变化，该阶段主要是解决「能不能」的问题，主要集中在引擎的基础计算存储能力、稳定性、以及围绕引擎的各类工具组件的能力建设。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >2.&nbsp;快速发展阶段</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >随着引擎基础能力的相对完善，大数据各类应用场景激增，如何基于大数据系统快速实现业务数据化的矛盾开始凸显，特别是随着存储和计算能力提升，传统数据仓库的性能限制逐步打开，更加会倾向于在一个平台上完成从数据的获取、整合、加工以及到最后的数据应用的过程，这个时候数据仓库的概念逐步泛化，这个阶段主要是「快不快」的问题，因此诞生了一站式数据研发平台（如：</font>Dataworks），同时，由于业务场景越来越多，对于引擎的性能、稳定性也提出了更高的要求。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >3.&nbsp;成熟阶段</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >随着大数据生态的日趋成熟，数据应用场景的深度和广度被极大地拓展，几乎处处都有大数据的需求，人人都是数据研发者，数据量急速膨胀，大数据系统快速熵增，随着而来的各类问题也开始显现，如沟通协作成本上升，导致数据不好找、不敢用，降低了需求吞吐量，导致各种组织摩擦；大量非专业人员的分布式研发，数据口径不一，产出保障困难导致大量数据质量问题；还有各种重复研发导致的成本浪费；还有数据安全合规问题也开始凸显。由此数据中台开始构建，数据建模、数据治理等各类方法论开始指导数据中台建设，诞生了</font> Dataphin 等建模研发平台。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >4.&nbsp;突破阶段</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >随着大数据时代的发展，环境发生了变化，使得数据仓库这种先处理后使用的方式成本激增。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >首先，数据量发生了显著的增加，对数据仓库的存储是一个巨大的挑战；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >其次，数据结构也非常</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >多元化，不再都是结构化数据，而是出现了半结构化数据</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，甚至语音视频等非结构数据。但是人们同时意识到数据包含巨大的潜在价值，对于很多数据，即使暂时没有明确的需求，也想先留一份。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >所以，</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >妥协的办法出现了，从先处理后用，变成了先存储，以后用的时候再考虑怎么处理。这就是数据湖的处理方式</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。这样做有两个好处，一个是保留了原始数据的原汁原味，这样可以避免任何前期的数据加工造成的数据变形。另外一个好处就是节约了前期数据接入时的成本。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据湖是一个以原始格式</font>(通常是对象块或文件)存储数据的系统或存储库</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。数据湖通常是所有企业数据的单一存储。用于报告、可视化、高级分析和机器学习等任务。数据湖可以包括来自关系数据库的结构化数据</font>(行和列)、半结构化数据(CSV、日志、XML、JSON)、非结构化数据(电子邮件、文档、pdf)和二进制数据(图像、音频、视频)。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库</font>VS数据湖的差异如下：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><table class=3DMsoNormalTable  border=3D1  cellspacing=3D0  style=3D"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:2.4000pt;border:none;=20mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;mso-padding-alt:0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt ;" ><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >特性</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据湖</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >经过预处理的结构化的关系数据</f