pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >更快查询结果会带来较高存储成本</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >更快查询结果只需较低存储成本</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据质量</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >可作为重要事实依据的高度监管数据</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >任何可以或无法进行监管的数据（例如原始数据）</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >用户</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >业务分析师</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据科学家、数据开发人员和业务分析师（使用监管数据）</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >分析</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >批处理报告、</font>BI 和可视化</span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >机器学习、预测分析、数据发现和分析</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >最初构思数据湖时，人们认为只需要提取数据并将其放入数据湖即可。一旦进入数据湖，终端用户就可以一头扎进去，找到数据并进行分析。然而，企业很快发现，使用数据湖中的数据与仅仅将数据放入湖中完全是两码事。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"575"  src=3D"~tmp{9914212b-49a3-4e51-a0ed-1f0514e814e7}135022.files/~tmp{9914212b-49a3-4e51-a0ed-1f0514e814e7}1350221887.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >当前，业界出现了一种称为</font> </span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >data lakehouse（湖仓一体） 的新型数据架构，它通过一种新的开放和标准化的系统设计来实现：其实现与数据仓库中类似的数据结构和数据管理功能，并将数据存放在数据湖使用的低成本存储系统中。</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >目前作为前沿的大数据架构，数据湖和数据仓库一体正蓬勃发展，有望成为新一代的大数据应用架构。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

